5. For each page, a shape, by key, from exactly this list:
{% for key, blurb in layouts %}   - {{ key }} — {{ blurb }}
{% endfor %}
   THE FRONT PAGE IS A REAL CHOICE. Four of these can open a site and they
   suit different businesses: one that sells packages should show what they
   cost; one whose work is booked in advance should show how it goes; one
   whose voice is the product should open on words, not a photograph. Pick
   the one this business actually needs. Do not default to "landing" — it
   is one of four, not the normal one.

   The pages after it are usually quieter: "simple" for contact or terms,
   "story" for an about page, "showcase" for anything you look at.

6. One sentence saying why this look suits this business. It is shown to the
